    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĭgillārīcĭus</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> ),
			a, um, adj.
		sigilla. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>belonging to
			sealing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anulus,</span>”
				<i>a seal-ring</i>, <i>signet-ring</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vop. Aur. 50</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĭgillārīcĭa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>little images;</i> v. Sigillaria, II. A. 1.</div>
